Comment: 100,0:00:00.00,0:36:59.20,GJM_Main_1080p,chapter,0,0,0,,Movie
Comment: 100,0:36:59.20,0:39:33.43,GJM_Main_1080p,chapter,0,0,0,,Credits
Dialogue: 100,0:00:15.75,0:00:17.08,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,It's been a while, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 100,0:00:18.04,0:00:19.67,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Since we've all been together.
Dialogue: 100,0:00:19.96,0:00:21.08,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,It really has.
Dialogue: 100,0:00:22.00,0:00:23.04,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Sorry we couldn't do this sooner.
Dialogue: 100,0:00:23.29,0:00:24.46,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 100,0:00:25.17,0:00:26.84,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,I'm just glad we can see each other at all.
Dialogue: 100,0:00:30.34,0:00:33.35,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,So, summer's come again, huh?
Dialogue: 100,0:00:37.89,0:00:39.69,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,A year's come and gone, huh?
Dialogue: 100,0:00:42.57,0:00:43.69,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Ayane.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:01.08,0:01:02.17,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Are you Aoi?
Dialogue: 100,0:01:02.17,0:01:04.21,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Ah, yeah.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:04.21,0:01:07.38,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Cool. I'm Sugisaki Tomoya.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:07.84,0:01:08.71,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:09.51,0:01:10.63,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,You guys are eager.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:12.05,0:01:13.43,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Even I've got five minutes.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:14.93,0:01:15.97,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,I'm Ryou.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:16.43,0:01:17.39,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you two.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:17.39,0:01:18.52,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,You, too.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:18.52,0:01:20.89,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Okay. Looks like we're all here.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:22.60,0:01:24.11,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Shall we get started?
Dialogue: 100,0:01:28.15,0:01:29.28,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,First, let's lay everything out.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:29.65,0:01:33.49,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,We all came here today to find a ghost.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:33.74,0:01:35.07,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,The Summer Ghost, to be exact.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:35.53,0:01:36.70,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,For the past couple years,
Dialogue: 100,0:01:37.33,0:01:39.08,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,it's been spotted around here every summer.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:39.58,0:01:41.66,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,I hear you've gotta have fireworks.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:42.08,0:01:42.96,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Fireworks?
Dialogue: 100,0:01:42.96,0:01:45.54,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,{\q2}Yeah. Apparently everyone \Nwho's seen it was playing with 'em.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:47.25,0:01:48.88,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,It's supposedly a woman \Nin her early twenties.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:50.13,0:01:52.68,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,She's got long hair and black clothes.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:53.59,0:01:56.51,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,{\q2}If I had to draw her, \Nshe'd probably look something like this.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:56.89,0:01:57.93,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,You're so good.
Dialogue: 100,0:01:59.47,0:02:01.10,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,A pretty lady like her, huh?
Dialogue: 100,0:02:02.94,0:02:04.65,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,If the rumors are true, then this ghost
Dialogue: 100,0:02:06.52,0:02:08.40,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,is the ghost of someone \Nwho committed suicide.
Dialogue: 100,0:02:13.36,0:02:14.16,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 100,0:02:14.16,0:02:15.78,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,O-Oh, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 100,0:02:16.41,0:02:20.24,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,{\q2}Just, now that it's had time to sink in, \NI've realized I'm kinda scared of ghosts.
Dialogue: 100,0:02:20.24,0:02:22.04,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,This late in the game?
Dialogue: 100,0:02:23.12,0:02:24.87,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,I mean, whatever, you don't have to come.
Dialogue: 100,0:02:24.87,0:02:25.50,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,I know I'm going.
Dialogue: 100,0:02:25.50,0:02:29.25,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Sorry! I'm just being silly! I'm coming, too!
Dialogue: 100,0:02:29.25,0:02:31.80,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Sure, I'm scared, but it's just a little bit.
Dialogue: 100,0:02:31.80,0:02:36.43,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,{\q2}Oh, actually, why do you want \Nto see this ghost, Tomoya?
Dialogue: 100,0:02:36.43,0:02:39.22,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,{\q2}I mean, you were the one \Nwho reached out to us about this.
Dialogue: 100,0:02:40.97,0:02:41.68,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 100,0:02:41.93,0:02:44.27,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Come on! What's that about?
Dialogue: 100,0:02:44.77,0:02:45.44,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Ouch, dude.
Dialogue: 100,0:02:50.27,0:02:51.73,GJM_Main_1080p,Te,0,0,0,,Sugisaki.
Dialogue: 100,0:02:52.61,0:02:56.24,GJM_Main_1080p,Te,0,0,0,,A, A, A, A, A...
Dialogue: 100,0:02:57.03,0:02:58.66,GJM_Main_1080p,Te,0,0,0,,Looking good.
Dialogue: 100,0:02:58.66,0:03:01.20,GJM_Main_1080p,Te,0,0,0,,You never fail to impress me.
Dialogue: 100,0:03:01.20,0:03:03.49,GJM_Main_1080p,Te,0,0,0,,I wish the other students \Nwould learn from you.
Dialogue: 100,0:03:03.92,0:03:05.20,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 100,0:03:06.62,0:03:07.96,GJM_Main_1080p,Te,0,0,0,,Sugisaki.
Dialogue: 100,0:03:07.96,0:03:08.73,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 100,0:03:11.63,0:03:12.67,GJM_Main_1080p,Te,0,0,0,,You're gonna go far.
Dialogue: 100,0:03:35.95,0:03:36.40,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Tomoya.
Dialogue: 100,0:03:38.91,0:03:40.49,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,What are you spacing out for?
Dialogue: 100,0:03:41.66,0:03:42.49,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,We're here.
Dialogue: 100,0:03:54.88,0:03:55.97,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Look at all this space!
Dialogue: 100,0:03:55.97,0:03:58.05,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,This used to be an airport.
Dialogue: 100,0:03:58.05,0:04:00.05,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,I heard it closed down \Nbecause it wasn't profitable.
Dialogue: 100,0:04:00.05,0:04:02.72,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Guys! Let's get started already.
Dialogue: 100,0:04:09.19,0:04:12.32,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,You think this Summer Ghost really exists?
Dialogue: 100,0:04:13.07,0:04:14.28,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 100,0:04:14.28,0:04:17.28,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,{\q2}They do say that fireworks are meant \Nto calm the souls of the dead.
Dialogue: 100,0:04:19.86,0:04:21.66,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,I hope they see them, then.
Dialogue: 100,0:04:29.75,0:04:31.08,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Looks like it's a no-show.
Dialogue: 100,0:04:31.63,0:04:33.59,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,And we burned through so many, too.
Dialogue: 100,0:04:33.92,0:04:35.88,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Okay. Last one.
Dialogue: 100,0:04:35.88,0:04:36.76,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Could you, Aoi?
Dialogue: 100,0:04:45.64,0:04:49.89,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,{\q2}You know, Tomoya, I actually \Nbelieved we'd get to see it.
Dialogue: 100,0:04:51.06,0:04:52.48,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,I'm kinda sad it didn't show up.
Dialogue: 100,0:04:53.06,0:04:55.65,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Still, though, I haven't \Nhad this much fun in a while.
Dialogue: 100,0:04:56.65,0:04:57.99,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,I'm glad I got to meet you guys.
Dialogue: 100,0:04:58.95,0:04:59.78,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Seriously, thank you.
Dialogue: 100,0:05:10.46,0:05:12.00,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Damn, that's hot!
Dialogue: 100,0:05:12.00,0:05:13.13,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 100,0:05:13.13,0:05:14.42,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Why's it going crazy?
Dialogue: 100,0:05:15.67,0:05:16.50,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,She's real.
Dialogue: 100,0:05:25.47,0:05:27.06,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Are you the Summer Ghost?
Dialogue: 100,0:05:28.18,0:05:29.06,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 100,0:05:30.35,0:05:31.77,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,To what do I owe the pleasure?
Dialogue: 100,0:05:32.77,0:05:34.19,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,What could you possibly want
Dialogue: 100,0:05:35.15,0:05:36.82,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,from someone who's already dead?
Dialogue: 100,0:06:03.93,0:06:05.05,GJM_Main_1080p,A,0,0,0,,{\an8}Direct hit!
Dialogue: 100,0:06:03.93,0:06:05.85,GJM_Overlap_1080p,B,0,0,0,,{\an8}Your timing's on point, dude.
Dialogue: 100,0:06:05.05,0:06:05.85,GJM_Main_1080p,C,0,0,0,,{\an8}Nice one.
Dialogue: 100,0:06:13.10,0:06:14.85,GJM_Main_1080p,A,0,0,0,,The hell are you doing?!
Dialogue: 100,0:06:14.85,0:06:15.94,GJM_Main_1080p,A,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 100,0:06:15.94,0:06:17.40,GJM_Main_1080p,A,0,0,0,,Quit struggling and get down here!
Dialogue: 100,0:06:15.94,0:06:17.40,GJM_Overlap_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 100,0:06:17.90,0:06:21.24,GJM_Main_1080p,D,0,0,0,,{\q2}She finally decides to come to school, \Nand we're back to this already?
Dialogue: 100,0:06:21.24,0:06:25.03,GJM_Main_1080p,E,0,0,0,,If you ask me, the problem's with her.
Dialogue: 100,0:06:32.20,0:06:36.17,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Do ghosts gang up on each other, too?
Dialogue: 100,0:06:37.25,0:06:38.88,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Hmm, I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 100,0:06:39.38,0:06:41.38,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,We might be all on our own, actually.
Dialogue: 100,0:06:43.63,0:06:45.26,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 100,0:06:45.26,0:06:46.97,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,I prefer it that way.
Dialogue: 100,0:06:46.97,0:06:50.60,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I get it. Being around people isn't all smiles.
Dialogue: 100,0:06:52.81,0:06:53.60,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 100,0:06:54.06,0:06:57.44,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Nothing. Just noticed \Nthat the sparkler's still going.
Dialogue: 100,0:06:57.44,0:07:00.15,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,You're right. Kinda creepy.
Dialogue: 100,0:07:01.73,0:07:05.53,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Tell me. Are you an outcast at school?
Dialogue: 100,0:07:05.53,0:07:07.49,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Is that why you want to die?
Dialogue: 100,0:07:08.70,0:07:11.54,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Thing is, not everyone can see me.
Dialogue: 100,0:07:11.54,0:07:13.41,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I'm visible only to those
Dialogue: 100,0:07:13.41,0:07:15.96,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,who are within arm's reach of death.
Dialogue: 100,0:07:17.54,0:07:20.62,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,So Tomoya and Ryou also...
Dialogue: 100,0:07:24.34,0:07:26.05,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,What about you two?
Dialogue: 100,0:07:26.55,0:07:27.59,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Any questions?
Dialogue: 100,0:07:28.84,0:07:30.18,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,So Summer Ghost, you're—
Dialogue: 100,0:07:30.18,0:07:31.43,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Satou Ayane.
Dialogue: 100,0:07:34.10,0:07:35.69,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I have a name.
Dialogue: 100,0:07:36.81,0:07:39.11,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,So Ayane, you're a ghost, right?
Dialogue: 100,0:07:39.11,0:07:40.94,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Does everyone become one after they die?
Dialogue: 100,0:07:41.32,0:07:42.40,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Dunno.
Dialogue: 100,0:07:43.11,0:07:44.69,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,What do you want to know?
Dialogue: 100,0:07:44.99,0:07:48.32,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,How do ghosts perceive this world?
Dialogue: 100,0:07:48.82,0:07:50.03,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,I'm curious.
Dialogue: 100,0:07:52.03,0:07:53.16,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I wish I could tell you.
Dialogue: 100,0:07:54.20,0:07:56.21,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,It's not something so easily explained.
Dialogue: 100,0:07:57.46,0:08:00.25,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,{\q2}Some things you can only understand \Nafter you become a ghost.
Dialogue: 100,0:08:01.17,0:08:02.84,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,It's about time I get going.
Dialogue: 100,0:08:03.42,0:08:04.92,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,It's been fun talking with you.
Dialogue: 100,0:08:06.01,0:08:06.76,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 100,0:08:08.18,0:08:09.47,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Boo.
Dialogue: 100,0:08:12.05,0:08:14.10,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,B-Boo.
Dialogue: 100,0:08:16.06,0:08:19.27,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,So ghosts really do exist, huh?
Dialogue: 100,0:08:24.69,0:08:25.65,GJM_Main_1080p,Dc,0,0,0,,That'll be all for today.
Dialogue: 100,0:08:26.24,0:08:28.24,GJM_Main_1080p,Dc,0,0,0,,If something happens, \Ncontact me immediately.
Dialogue: 100,0:08:28.57,0:08:29.78,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 100,0:08:30.24,0:08:31.74,GJM_Main_1080p,Dc,0,0,0,,Your parents not here today?
Dialogue: 100,0:08:31.74,0:08:33.41,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,I had them stay at home.
Dialogue: 100,0:08:33.78,0:08:35.95,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,No sense bringing them here just to cry.
Dialogue: 100,0:08:42.71,0:08:44.21,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,You're working hard, huh?
Dialogue: 100,0:08:44.92,0:08:46.05,GJM_Main_1080p,Kh,0,0,0,,Kobayashi!
Dialogue: 100,0:08:46.05,0:08:47.09,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Been a while.
Dialogue: 100,0:08:49.68,0:08:52.51,GJM_Main_1080p,Kh,0,0,0,,Hey, why did you quit playing?
Dialogue: 100,0:08:53.97,0:08:54.93,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Kinda felt like it.
Dialogue: 100,0:08:55.18,0:08:56.97,GJM_Main_1080p,Kh,0,0,0,,You... felt like it?
Dialogue: 100,0:08:58.02,0:09:00.14,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,I'm gonna die soon.
Dialogue: 100,0:09:00.14,0:09:00.60,GJM_Main_1080p,Kh,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 100,0:09:02.65,0:09:04.36,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,They're saying I've got nine months left.
Dialogue: 100,0:09:04.94,0:09:06.78,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,I'll never see the cherry blossoms again.
Dialogue: 100,0:09:10.99,0:09:12.24,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 100,0:09:13.32,0:09:14.33,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,What, you bought it?
Dialogue: 100,0:09:17.75,0:09:20.33,GJM_Main_1080p,Kh,0,0,0,,Oh, come on. Don't scare me like that.
Dialogue: 100,0:09:20.33,0:09:22.04,GJM_Main_1080p,Kh,0,0,0,,You almost had me worried there.
Dialogue: 100,0:09:41.64,0:09:42.23,GJM_Main_1080p,Mo,0,0,0,,Tomoya.
Dialogue: 100,0:09:42.98,0:09:44.06,GJM_Main_1080p,Mo,0,0,0,,I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 100,0:09:45.69,0:09:46.69,GJM_Main_1080p,Mo,0,0,0,,Tomoya!
Dialogue: 100,0:09:46.69,0:09:48.36,GJM_Main_1080p,Mo,0,0,0,,I know you can hear me.
Dialogue: 100,0:09:48.36,0:09:49.19,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Coming.
Dialogue: 100,0:09:50.78,0:09:54.20,GJM_Main_1080p,Mo,0,0,0,,{\q2}These are your acceptance odds based on \Nyour first trimester mock exams.
Dialogue: 100,0:09:54.20,0:09:56.12,GJM_Main_1080p,Mo,0,0,0,,Your math scores are passable, if barely.
Dialogue: 100,0:09:56.58,0:09:58.74,GJM_Main_1080p,Mo,0,0,0,,{\q2}Your contemporary literature \Nones need work, though.
Dialogue: 100,0:09:59.25,0:10:01.04,GJM_Main_1080p,Mo,0,0,0,,You can't just write your own thoughts.
Dialogue: 100,0:10:01.04,0:10:02.71,GJM_Main_1080p,Mo,0,0,0,,You have to follow the rubric.
Dialogue: 100,0:10:03.58,0:10:05.38,GJM_Main_1080p,Mo,0,0,0,,I know you understand that.
Dialogue: 100,0:10:06.00,0:10:07.88,GJM_Main_1080p,Mo,0,0,0,,Why is it just this one thing?
Dialogue: 100,0:10:17.53,0:10:19.77,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Huh, you go to cram school even on Sundays?
Dialogue: 100,0:10:20.06,0:10:22.23,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Yeah, since I finish high school this year.
Dialogue: 100,0:10:22.94,0:10:25.52,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Huh? I've still got a year to go after this.
Dialogue: 100,0:10:25.52,0:10:26.65,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,You're older than me, Tomoya?
Dialogue: 100,0:10:26.65,0:10:29.44,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Really? You're only a junior, then?
Dialogue: 100,0:10:29.44,0:10:31.64,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,What, you're older, too?
Dialogue: 100,0:10:32.70,0:10:34.41,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Yeah, but it doesn't matter. We're friends.
Dialogue: 100,0:10:57.47,0:10:58.51,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao/Ry,0,0,0,,{\pos(306,1020)}Hello?
Dialogue: 100,0:10:57.47,0:10:58.51,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao/Ry,0,0,0,,{\pos(1614,1020)}Hello?
Dialogue: 100,0:10:58.51,0:11:00.64,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Aoi?
Dialogue: 100,0:11:00.64,0:11:01.77,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 100,0:11:01.77,0:11:04.85,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,No. Not really.
Dialogue: 100,0:11:04.85,0:11:06.35,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 100,0:11:06.35,0:11:08.90,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,I still can't believe what we saw.
Dialogue: 100,0:11:08.90,0:11:12.03,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Don't let it get to you.
Dialogue: 100,0:11:12.57,0:11:14.53,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,It'd be weird if you {\i1}weren't{\i0} spooked.
Dialogue: 100,0:11:17.07,0:11:17.91,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Tomoya?
Dialogue: 100,0:11:18.45,0:11:19.53,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 100,0:11:19.53,0:11:21.58,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,I'm almost home, so I'm gonna hang up.
Dialogue: 100,0:11:21.58,0:11:23.37,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Glad it wasn't anything serious.
Dialogue: 100,0:11:23.37,0:11:24.33,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 100,0:11:30.42,0:11:32.59,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Heya. Fancy seeing you again.
Dialogue: 100,0:11:33.63,0:11:37.18,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,{\q2}Something tells me you \Nweren't satisfied by our last meeting.
Dialogue: 100,0:11:37.68,0:11:38.93,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Not entirely.
Dialogue: 100,0:11:41.31,0:11:42.56,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,You just want it all, don't you?
Dialogue: 100,0:11:45.81,0:11:48.77,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I'm curious. Why are you alive?
Dialogue: 100,0:11:49.98,0:11:52.48,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Do I look alive to you?
Dialogue: 100,0:11:52.73,0:11:53.73,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I'd say so.
Dialogue: 100,0:11:55.15,0:11:58.53,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,I don't really feel alive, to be honest.
Dialogue: 100,0:11:59.49,0:12:04.04,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,I sometimes wonder \Nwhether I'm not already dead.
Dialogue: 100,0:12:05.41,0:12:07.83,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,It's because you're dead inside.
Dialogue: 100,0:12:08.33,0:12:09.17,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,That's not good for you.
Dialogue: 100,0:12:09.63,0:12:11.29,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Don't wanna hear that from a ghost.
Dialogue: 100,0:12:11.84,0:12:14.09,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,So, what are you going to do about it?
Dialogue: 100,0:12:16.72,0:12:17.88,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 100,0:12:19.34,0:12:21.14,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,That's what I was hoping to find out.
Dialogue: 100,0:12:22.22,0:12:27.52,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,{\q2}Would all my worries, all my suffering, \Nsimply disappear if I became a ghost?
Dialogue: 100,0:12:28.19,0:12:32.61,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,{\q2}I kind of figured something \Nmight change if I learned that.
Dialogue: 100,0:12:34.36,0:12:35.40,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 100,0:12:37.24,0:12:38.65,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,There's only one way to find out.
Dialogue: 100,0:12:42.28,0:12:44.74,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Let's get you out of your shell.{WE'RE KEEPING THIS LINE YOU'RE NOT CONVINCING ME OTHERWISE}{NN: Fiiiiiiiiiiiiiiine. You don't have to fight me too hard to keep groaners.}
Dialogue: 100,0:12:45.08,0:12:46.66,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Don't you want to fly?
Dialogue: 100,0:12:58.05,0:12:58.97,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 100,0:12:59.88,0:13:02.76,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,You ready? Make sure to hold on tight!
Comment: 100,0:13:02.93,0:13:03.51,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 100,0:13:15.19,0:13:16.36,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,How is it?
Dialogue: 100,0:13:16.36,0:13:19.78,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Your body's on the ground. \NBut your soul's flying!
Dialogue: 100,0:13:19.78,0:13:21.16,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,You've been freed!
Dialogue: 100,0:13:24.49,0:13:25.95,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Awesome.
Dialogue: 100,0:13:28.54,0:13:29.96,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 100,0:13:53.10,0:13:54.48,GJM_Main_Italic_1080p,To,0,0,0,,I'm inside the ground?
Dialogue: 100,0:13:56.40,0:13:57.82,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Sorry. I couldn't resist.
Dialogue: 100,0:13:57.82,0:14:01.03,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I wanted to see how you'd react.
Dialogue: 100,0:14:01.36,0:14:03.07,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Th-That's just mean.
Dialogue: 100,0:14:03.32,0:14:04.82,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I said I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 100,0:14:05.32,0:14:08.45,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I'll teach you how to fly. \NWill that make up for it?
Dialogue: 100,0:14:10.62,0:14:11.79,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Look deep inside you.
Dialogue: 100,0:14:12.41,0:14:15.46,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Find the deepest wish in your heart.
Dialogue: 100,0:14:16.88,0:14:19.21,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Your soul moves where you wish to be.
Dialogue: 100,0:14:20.05,0:14:22.34,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 100,0:14:23.26,0:14:25.09,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Where do you want to go?
Dialogue: 100,0:14:35.27,0:14:37.19,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,You like paintings, don't you?
Dialogue: 100,0:14:37.19,0:14:40.86,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,I do. I quit making them myself, though.
Dialogue: 100,0:14:40.86,0:14:43.11,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,There's more important things in life, after all.
Dialogue: 100,0:14:43.95,0:14:45.74,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,So that's why you seem so dissociated.
Dialogue: 100,0:14:46.53,0:14:47.95,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,It's such a waste.
Dialogue: 100,0:14:47.95,0:14:49.79,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,You're just throwing away this opportunity.
Dialogue: 100,0:14:50.20,0:14:52.33,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,You're a ghost right now.
Dialogue: 100,0:14:52.33,0:14:53.79,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,No one can get mad at you, you know.
Dialogue: 100,0:15:21.28,0:15:23.78,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Beautiful, huh? All the city lights.
Dialogue: 100,0:15:24.53,0:15:25.61,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 100,0:15:27.36,0:15:30.58,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Though it could be brighter, I guess.
Dialogue: 100,0:15:30.58,0:15:32.29,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Since all the lights aren't on at once.
Dialogue: 100,0:15:32.29,0:15:35.54,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,{\q2}Come on, you're not going to \Nwin over any girls like that.
Dialogue: 100,0:15:35.54,0:15:37.12,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Just say thank you like a normal person.
Dialogue: 100,0:15:37.62,0:15:38.83,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,My bad.
Dialogue: 100,0:15:41.30,0:15:44.05,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Hey, may I ask you something?
Dialogue: 100,0:15:44.51,0:15:45.13,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 100,0:15:46.39,0:15:49.60,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Why did you commit suicide?
Dialogue: 100,0:15:52.01,0:15:53.22,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Tomoya.
Dialogue: 100,0:15:55.18,0:15:56.81,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,You've got it wrong.
Dialogue: 100,0:15:57.69,0:15:59.06,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I didn't commit suicide.
Dialogue: 100,0:16:00.86,0:16:01.90,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Are you curious?
Dialogue: 100,0:16:03.48,0:16:05.03,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I'll tell you my story, then.
Dialogue: 100,0:16:06.36,0:16:07.32,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,The truth is...
Dialogue: 100,0:16:09.20,0:16:10.37,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I was killed.
Dialogue: 100,0:16:13.91,0:16:15.00,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 100,0:16:15.00,0:16:16.25,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,This is my house.
Dialogue: 100,0:16:16.62,0:16:19.08,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,My mom lives here on her own now.
Dialogue: 100,0:16:23.25,0:16:26.63,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Three years ago, we got into a nasty fight.
Dialogue: 100,0:16:27.42,0:16:31.14,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,{\q2}Over something so incredibly stupid, too.
Dialogue: 100,0:16:31.55,0:16:35.22,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I dashed out of the house \Ninto a horrible typhoon.
Dialogue: 100,0:16:37.43,0:16:39.48,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,And while I was crossing the street,
Dialogue: 100,0:16:39.48,0:16:42.56,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I was hit by a car that ignored a red light.
Dialogue: 100,0:16:43.36,0:16:44.98,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,It's such a stupid way to die.
Dialogue: 100,0:16:46.99,0:16:49.82,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Except, well, that didn't actually kill me.
Dialogue: 100,0:16:49.82,0:16:51.74,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I was simply unconscious at that point.
Dialogue: 100,0:16:52.62,0:16:55.95,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,But when I woke up, \NI was trapped someplace tiny.
Dialogue: 100,0:16:56.70,0:16:58.83,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Probably in a suitcase.
Dialogue: 100,0:16:58.83,0:16:59.92,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 100,0:16:59.92,0:17:01.88,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,To cover up all traces of the accident.
Dialogue: 100,0:17:02.96,0:17:05.25,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,The driver of that car buried me somewhere.
Dialogue: 100,0:17:06.17,0:17:10.01,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,{\q2}I couldn't breathe, and the only thing \NI could hear was a distant train.
Dialogue: 100,0:17:11.51,0:17:14.60,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,That's my last memory among the living.
Dialogue: 100,0:17:17.02,0:17:19.39,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,My mom is still waiting for me to come back.
Dialogue: 100,0:17:20.10,0:17:21.73,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Where were you buried?
Dialogue: 100,0:17:21.98,0:17:24.23,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,{\q2}I've tried to find that out, \Nbut I've long since given up.
Dialogue: 100,0:17:24.69,0:17:26.73,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,It's not like it'd change anything at this point.
Dialogue: 100,0:17:29.44,0:17:32.74,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Gosh, there were so many \Nthings I still wanted to do.
Dialogue: 100,0:17:33.24,0:17:35.20,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Travel, fall in love...
Dialogue: 100,0:17:35.70,0:17:38.25,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I'm jealous of the bright future ahead of you.
Dialogue: 100,0:17:39.71,0:17:41.96,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,But you {\i1}can{\i0} travel, no?
Dialogue: 100,0:17:41.96,0:17:43.54,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,It wouldn't even cost you anything.
Dialogue: 100,0:17:43.54,0:17:44.50,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Careful.
Dialogue: 100,0:17:44.84,0:17:46.88,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,That was really tactless of you.
Dialogue: 100,0:17:46.88,0:17:48.59,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Minus twenty points.
Dialogue: 100,0:17:50.38,0:17:54.09,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Personally, I think you have it better.
Dialogue: 100,0:17:56.39,0:17:57.22,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Tomoya.
Dialogue: 100,0:17:57.64,0:17:58.77,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 100,0:17:59.73,0:18:02.48,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I want to find my body.
Dialogue: 100,0:18:04.06,0:18:06.36,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,It might just be possible if you help me.
Dialogue: 100,0:18:06.90,0:18:11.86,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,{\q2}I only gave up on it because I wouldn't \Nbe able to do anything even if I did.
Dialogue: 100,0:18:18.95,0:18:20.15,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 100,0:18:20.15,0:18:21.96,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,The whole point of this was to cheer you up.
Dialogue: 100,0:18:22.71,0:18:24.17,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Pretend I didn't say anything.
Dialogue: 100,0:18:25.92,0:18:27.17,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Boo.
Dialogue: 100,0:19:11.17,0:19:13.01,GJM_Main_1080p,Mo,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you be in cram school?
Dialogue: 100,0:19:15.09,0:19:16.09,GJM_Main_1080p,Mo,0,0,0,,Get in.
Dialogue: 100,0:19:17.93,0:19:19.43,GJM_Main_1080p,Mo,0,0,0,,It's already the second trimester.
Dialogue: 100,0:19:20.14,0:19:22.14,GJM_Main_1080p,Mo,0,0,0,,You've been wandering off, haven't you?
Dialogue: 100,0:19:22.85,0:19:24.31,GJM_Main_1080p,Mo,0,0,0,,You can't lie to me.
Dialogue: 100,0:19:24.31,0:19:27.27,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I'm looking for a friend.
Dialogue: 100,0:19:27.69,0:19:28.86,GJM_Main_1080p,Mo,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 100,0:19:28.86,0:19:30.69,GJM_Main_1080p,Mo,0,0,0,,Is {\i1}that{\i0} more important than your future?
Dialogue: 100,0:19:31.73,0:19:34.74,GJM_Main_1080p,Mo,0,0,0,,{\q2}I'll be coming to your cram school \Nto make sure you're there next week.
Dialogue: 100,0:19:34.74,0:19:36.32,GJM_Main_1080p,Mo,0,0,0,,High time you faced reality.
Dialogue: 100,0:19:37.41,0:19:38.45,GJM_Main_1080p,Mo,0,0,0,,T-Tomoya!
Dialogue: 100,0:19:38.87,0:19:39.74,GJM_Main_1080p,Mo,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 100,0:19:50.88,0:19:54.17,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,We couldn't find it today either.
Dialogue: 100,0:19:55.67,0:19:56.51,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 100,0:19:57.34,0:19:58.39,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 100,0:19:58.39,0:19:59.64,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,There's no need for that.
Dialogue: 100,0:20:00.22,0:20:02.18,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Consider this more of a date.
Dialogue: 100,0:20:04.23,0:20:06.89,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,I have entrance exams this year.
Dialogue: 100,0:20:08.48,0:20:13.11,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,{\q2}Once I start college, I don't know \Nhow much I'll be able to come here.
Dialogue: 100,0:20:14.65,0:20:15.61,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 100,0:20:17.07,0:20:19.32,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Then let's end our \Nsoul-searching journey here.
Dialogue: 100,0:20:19.32,0:20:19.70,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 100,0:20:21.32,0:20:23.24,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Summer is about to end.
Dialogue: 100,0:20:23.24,0:20:24.83,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,It's a good stopping point.
Dialogue: 100,0:20:24.83,0:20:26.71,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,But we don't need to give up comple—
Dialogue: 100,0:20:26.71,0:20:28.08,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 100,0:20:28.62,0:20:30.96,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I don't want to distract you.
Dialogue: 100,0:20:30.96,0:20:34.63,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,You have more important things to focus on than me.
Dialogue: 100,0:20:34.63,0:20:35.30,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 100,0:20:35.30,0:20:36.97,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Minus two million points.
Dialogue: 100,0:20:37.88,0:20:40.26,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Being stubborn isn't \Ngoing to win over any girls.
Dialogue: 100,0:20:41.09,0:20:43.22,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I said it's fine.
Dialogue: 100,0:20:43.68,0:20:47.81,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,{\q2}Does that mean you won't \Nbe around for much longer?
Dialogue: 100,0:20:48.52,0:20:49.48,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Possibly.
Dialogue: 100,0:20:51.15,0:20:52.27,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 100,0:20:53.15,0:20:54.57,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,I'll see you tomorrow evening.
Dialogue: 100,0:20:56.11,0:20:57.36,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Wait for me, please.
Dialogue: 100,0:20:59.99,0:21:01.11,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Can we meet up?
Dialogue: 100,0:21:03.12,0:21:04.45,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,I wanna talk about something.
Dialogue: 100,0:21:05.66,0:21:07.37,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,I want to find Ayane's body.
Dialogue: 100,0:21:08.04,0:21:09.71,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Will you help me?
Dialogue: 100,0:21:11.04,0:21:12.75,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,I knew it'd be something like that.
Dialogue: 100,0:21:13.71,0:21:16.34,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,You've been seeing her a lot lately, huh?
Dialogue: 100,0:21:16.34,0:21:18.07,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 100,0:21:18.51,0:21:20.09,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,You in love or something?
Dialogue: 100,0:21:20.80,0:21:21.51,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 100,0:21:22.80,0:21:24.01,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Well, whatever.
Dialogue: 100,0:21:24.60,0:21:25.85,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,I'm not helping, either way.
Dialogue: 100,0:21:27.06,0:21:29.52,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,{\q2}Can't bring myself to help \Nsomeone who killed herself.
Dialogue: 100,0:21:29.52,0:21:30.60,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,That's not what happened.
Dialogue: 100,0:21:30.60,0:21:32.34,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,She died by no fault of her own.
Dialogue: 100,0:21:33.56,0:21:35.07,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,This is really important.
Dialogue: 100,0:21:35.65,0:21:37.32,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,If I don't see this through,
Dialogue: 100,0:21:37.98,0:21:40.11,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,I think I'll regret it for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 100,0:21:40.61,0:21:41.70,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,That a fact?
Dialogue: 100,0:21:42.78,0:21:44.20,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Well, good luck.
Dialogue: 100,0:21:44.74,0:21:45.20,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Ryou—
Dialogue: 100,0:21:45.20,0:21:46.24,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Don't.
Dialogue: 100,0:21:46.24,0:21:46.49,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Wait—
Dialogue: 100,0:21:46.49,0:21:47.74,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Seriously, don't!
Dialogue: 100,0:21:49.62,0:21:50.96,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Just drop it.
Dialogue: 100,0:21:51.46,0:21:52.54,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,I don't wanna hear it.
Dialogue: 100,0:21:53.79,0:21:56.88,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Must be nice having a future.
Dialogue: 100,0:21:58.34,0:21:59.92,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,I don't have that luxury.
Dialogue: 100,0:22:00.47,0:22:01.80,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,What does that...
Dialogue: 100,0:22:02.43,0:22:03.55,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Ryou!
Dialogue: 100,0:22:15.06,0:22:17.48,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Did something happen, Tomoya?
Dialogue: 100,0:22:17.48,0:22:19.65,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Nah. Nothing happened.
Dialogue: 100,0:22:20.61,0:22:21.40,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Let's start looking.
Dialogue: 100,0:22:22.20,0:22:23.36,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,We'll find your body today.
Dialogue: 100,0:22:27.83,0:22:28.79,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 100,0:22:29.83,0:22:30.54,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Ryou!
Dialogue: 100,0:22:43.51,0:22:44.05,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Ryou!
Dialogue: 100,0:22:44.05,0:22:45.05,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 100,0:22:47.35,0:22:48.43,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Just leave me alone.
Dialogue: 100,0:22:52.48,0:22:53.64,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 100,0:22:55.65,0:22:59.36,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,{\q2}It doesn't help that you can't \Ngo too far from your body.
Dialogue: 100,0:22:59.36,0:23:01.86,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Still, I won't stop until we find yours.
Dialogue: 100,0:23:03.90,0:23:04.95,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Tomoya.
Dialogue: 100,0:23:08.58,0:23:09.78,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Please, leave me alone.
Dialogue: 100,0:23:12.12,0:23:13.20,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,I knew it all along.
Dialogue: 100,0:23:14.62,0:23:16.63,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Meeting up with you guys was a mistake.
Dialogue: 100,0:23:18.75,0:23:21.96,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,{\q2}I would've suffered so much less \Nif I'd just let myself die alone.
Dialogue: 100,0:23:23.47,0:23:25.30,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Why did I do this to myself?
Dialogue: 100,0:23:27.14,0:23:28.43,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Why me?
Dialogue: 100,0:23:30.10,0:23:31.39,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Why is the world so unfair?
Dialogue: 100,0:23:32.81,0:23:33.77,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Ryou.
Dialogue: 100,0:23:34.85,0:23:39.15,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,{\q2}I won't try to pretend I understand, \Nbut at least hear me out.
Dialogue: 100,0:23:40.36,0:23:43.44,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,I get bullied pretty hard at school.
Dialogue: 100,0:23:44.40,0:23:46.15,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,It's put me in some dark places.
Dialogue: 100,0:23:47.16,0:23:52.66,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,{\q2}I'd begun to lose hope that \NI'd ever understand why I'm even alive.
Dialogue: 100,0:23:53.91,0:23:59.58,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,{\q2}To me, searching for a ghost \Nwas a search for new answers.
Dialogue: 100,0:24:00.54,0:24:03.55,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,{\q2}You might be struggling with \Nsomething completely different,
Dialogue: 100,0:24:03.88,0:24:07.13,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,but I'm sure Tomoya's fighting \Na battle of his own, too.
Dialogue: 100,0:24:08.51,0:24:12.35,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,{\q2}There has to be {\i1}some{\i0} meaning \Nin the three of us getting together.
Dialogue: 100,0:24:15.98,0:24:17.10,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 100,0:24:19.73,0:24:21.19,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Ayane.
Dialogue: 100,0:24:21.19,0:24:22.44,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Ayane!
Dialogue: 100,0:24:22.90,0:24:24.28,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 100,0:24:28.66,0:24:31.28,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,{\q2}I wouldn't expect you of all people \Nto come so poorly prepared.
Dialogue: 100,0:24:33.33,0:24:35.66,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Are you even trying, dude?
Dialogue: 100,0:24:40.58,0:24:41.50,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 100,0:24:42.29,0:24:47.88,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,{\q2}I was so focused on myself, \NI didn't consider your situation at all.
Dialogue: 100,0:24:48.51,0:24:51.09,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,I hate people like you.
Dialogue: 100,0:24:52.30,0:24:54.43,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,You think you've got it all figured out,
Dialogue: 100,0:24:54.68,0:24:57.35,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,and yet you look more pitiful than anyone.
Dialogue: 100,0:24:59.60,0:25:01.10,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,But I guess I can help you.
Dialogue: 100,0:25:02.02,0:25:03.44,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,You better thank Aoi for this.
Dialogue: 100,0:25:05.36,0:25:06.19,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Ryou.
Dialogue: 100,0:25:08.40,0:25:09.53,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Let's get this over with.
Dialogue: 100,0:25:13.45,0:25:14.62,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 100,0:25:39.93,0:25:42.06,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,You think we'll find it?
Dialogue: 100,0:25:42.40,0:25:45.19,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Of course. There's four of us now.
Dialogue: 100,0:25:47.23,0:25:50.11,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I didn't think you'd go this far for me.
Dialogue: 100,0:25:50.82,0:25:52.75,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I'm grateful towards all of you.
Dialogue: 100,0:25:53.57,0:25:55.53,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Nothing beats having friends, huh?
Dialogue: 100,0:25:56.70,0:25:57.66,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Make sure to cherish them.
Dialogue: 100,0:26:00.58,0:26:02.00,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Tomoya!
Dialogue: 100,0:26:02.33,0:26:03.71,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Aoi? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 100,0:26:03.71,0:26:04.68,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Come quickly!
Dialogue: 100,0:26:05.13,0:26:08.13,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,I think I might've found the suitcase.
Dialogue: 100,0:26:13.01,0:26:14.72,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Look there, Ayane.
Dialogue: 100,0:26:15.18,0:26:16.81,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Thanks. I'll go check it out.
Dialogue: 100,0:26:19.52,0:26:21.31,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,I wonder what's gonna happen to her.
Dialogue: 100,0:26:22.19,0:26:25.90,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Will she disappear once she finds her body?
Dialogue: 100,0:26:27.11,0:26:28.90,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,That's a little sad.
Dialogue: 100,0:26:32.24,0:26:34.41,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,You were right. I'm in there.
Dialogue: 100,0:26:34.66,0:26:36.74,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Great! Let's get back.
Dialogue: 100,0:26:36.74,0:26:37.12,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 100,0:26:38.95,0:26:39.79,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 100,0:26:40.91,0:26:43.47,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Hopefully my mom can rest easy now.
Dialogue: 100,0:26:44.17,0:26:46.96,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,So you {\i1}are{\i0} gonna disappear.
Dialogue: 100,0:26:47.67,0:26:48.88,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I'd expect so.
Dialogue: 100,0:26:49.63,0:26:51.63,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,But I had a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 100,0:26:51.63,0:26:53.80,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I made the most of my remaining time here.
Dialogue: 100,0:26:58.01,0:26:58.76,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Tomoya.
Dialogue: 100,0:27:00.22,0:27:01.44,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Hang in there.
Dialogue: 100,0:27:04.98,0:27:08.36,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,You have to keep on living.
Dialogue: 100,0:27:10.36,0:27:12.36,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Look. He's finally awake.
Dialogue: 100,0:27:12.61,0:27:14.28,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,What are you spacing out for?
Dialogue: 100,0:27:14.28,0:27:14.90,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 100,0:27:14.90,0:27:16.24,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 100,0:27:16.53,0:27:18.03,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I'm a little worried.
Dialogue: 100,0:27:18.03,0:27:20.45,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,You had so much fun while you were a ghost.
Dialogue: 100,0:27:21.24,0:27:27.00,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,{\q2}I hope you haven't started thinking \Ndeath might not be so bad.
Dialogue: 100,0:27:28.75,0:27:29.96,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,My, oh my.
Dialogue: 100,0:27:33.46,0:27:36.08,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for dragging you into this.
Dialogue: 100,0:27:40.26,0:27:40.68,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Ryou!
Dialogue: 100,0:27:40.68,0:27:42.27,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,I'm fine. Go on without me.
Dialogue: 100,0:27:43.10,0:27:44.85,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Don't make Ayane wait.
Dialogue: 100,0:27:52.48,0:27:53.48,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,It's gotta be here.
Dialogue: 100,0:27:53.48,0:27:54.32,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 100,0:27:54.78,0:27:55.99,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,But how do we get over?
Dialogue: 100,0:27:56.82,0:28:00.70,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,{\q2}You're going through your own thing, \Nand I selfishly dragged you into mine.
Dialogue: 100,0:28:02.16,0:28:02.87,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,And after all that,
Dialogue: 100,0:28:04.08,0:28:06.16,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I'm going to move on without you.
Dialogue: 100,0:28:07.58,0:28:09.25,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Don't miss me, please.
Dialogue: 100,0:28:09.25,0:28:10.13,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 100,0:28:11.29,0:28:12.92,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,I want to find you, Ayane.
Dialogue: 100,0:28:13.55,0:28:14.71,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,That's all that matters right now.
Dialogue: 100,0:28:18.38,0:28:19.26,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 100,0:28:22.51,0:28:24.60,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,I'm sure that'll give you your answer.
Dialogue: 100,0:28:25.43,0:28:29.81,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,{\q2}For you, death is in the future; \Nfor me, it's in the past.
Dialogue: 100,0:28:30.90,0:28:32.98,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,It's wedged right between us.
Dialogue: 100,0:28:42.41,0:28:43.24,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Aoi?
Dialogue: 100,0:28:43.24,0:28:46.25,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,You take it from here, Tomoya!
Dialogue: 100,0:29:11.31,0:29:11.73,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 100,0:29:12.94,0:29:15.36,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Tomoya?
Dialogue: 100,0:29:15.73,0:29:16.69,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Tomoya!
Dialogue: 100,0:29:21.66,0:29:24.62,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,You spent a lot of time \Ndetached from your body.
Dialogue: 100,0:29:25.12,0:29:26.74,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,That's why you're here right now.
Dialogue: 100,0:29:28.87,0:29:30.04,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,This place is death.
Dialogue: 100,0:29:30.92,0:29:32.04,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,There's nothing here.
Dialogue: 100,0:29:32.58,0:29:35.21,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,But it's also where all of your self is.
Dialogue: 100,0:29:38.72,0:29:40.87,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Once you burn this, it's all over.
Dialogue: 100,0:29:41.43,0:29:43.76,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,You'll part with the real world.
Dialogue: 100,0:29:50.06,0:29:52.65,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Yeah. I guess we shouldn't do this.
Dialogue: 100,0:29:54.15,0:29:55.98,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Why do you look so sad?
Dialogue: 100,0:29:58.32,0:30:01.32,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,What do you truly want?
Dialogue: 100,0:30:14.79,0:30:16.13,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Tomoya!
Dialogue: 100,0:30:17.30,0:30:19.30,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,The hell are you doing?! Wake up!
Dialogue: 100,0:30:19.30,0:30:19.96,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Ryou?
Dialogue: 100,0:30:19.96,0:30:22.01,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,You wanted to do this more than anyone.
Dialogue: 100,0:30:22.01,0:30:24.26,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,So see it through the end!
Dialogue: 100,0:30:24.26,0:30:26.68,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Why would you give up now?
Dialogue: 100,0:30:27.51,0:30:29.47,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Like hell I'm gonna let you!
Dialogue: 100,0:30:30.43,0:30:33.60,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,No. I have to go back.
Dialogue: 100,0:30:33.60,0:30:34.65,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 100,0:30:38.73,0:30:40.36,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,What's the point?
Dialogue: 100,0:30:41.03,0:30:44.78,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,{\q2}Why would you cling onto a world \Nthat only makes you suffer?
Dialogue: 100,0:30:49.66,0:30:50.29,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 100,0:30:56.13,0:30:59.75,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,You're right. My life's nothing but a chore.
Dialogue: 100,0:31:01.01,0:31:02.42,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,But it's not over yet!
Dialogue: 100,0:31:03.55,0:31:06.26,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Just like Ryou and Aoi,
Dialogue: 100,0:31:06.76,0:31:10.93,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,{\q2}I learned that if you just look up, \Nthere's always someone waiting to pick you up.
Dialogue: 100,0:31:12.18,0:31:14.31,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,You're not Ayane.
Dialogue: 100,0:31:14.31,0:31:16.27,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,{\q2}You're the part of me that's \Nlooking for a reason to die!
Dialogue: 100,0:31:17.19,0:31:21.40,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,I need to get back to \Nthe real world and find Ayane.
Dialogue: 100,0:31:22.07,0:31:23.78,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,My time's going to come one day.
Dialogue: 100,0:31:24.65,0:31:26.99,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Ayane's time has already passed.
Dialogue: 100,0:31:27.70,0:31:28.66,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,I've...
Dialogue: 100,0:31:29.28,0:31:31.58,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,I've gotta come to terms with those things first!
Dialogue: 100,0:31:54.43,0:31:54.93,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Tomoya!
Dialogue: 100,0:31:54.93,0:31:55.35,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Tomoya!
Dialogue: 100,0:32:26.72,0:32:27.76,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 100,0:32:40.98,0:32:43.86,GJM_Main_1080p,Ay,0,0,0,,Thank you for finding me.
Dialogue: 100,0:33:00.37,0:33:01.58,GJM_Main_1080p,Mo,0,0,0,,Coming.
Dialogue: 100,0:33:14.56,0:33:15.47,GJM_Main_1080p,Mo,0,0,0,,Ayane?
Dialogue: 100,0:33:58.64,0:34:01.48,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,So, summer's come again, huh?
Dialogue: 100,0:34:05.61,0:34:08.40,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,How have you guys been doing?
Dialogue: 100,0:34:09.03,0:34:10.44,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Things looking up at all?
Dialogue: 100,0:34:13.11,0:34:13.91,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 100,0:34:15.91,0:34:17.03,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Somewhat.
Dialogue: 100,0:34:21.66,0:34:25.54,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,{\q2}Living for yourself isn't the walk \Nin the park I thought it would be.
Dialogue: 100,0:34:26.42,0:34:27.17,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 100,0:34:29.92,0:34:32.51,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Of course my life isn't suddenly all roses, but...
Dialogue: 100,0:34:37.81,0:34:41.68,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,H-How long are you gonna \Nbehave like children?!
Dialogue: 100,0:34:41.68,0:34:43.81,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,But I feel like I'm taking small steps, at least.
Dialogue: 100,0:34:46.31,0:34:51.19,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Maybe it'd be easier \Nif I just did what I was told.
Dialogue: 100,0:34:52.32,0:34:53.82,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,I do doubt myself sometimes.
Dialogue: 100,0:34:55.53,0:34:56.41,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,But it's fine.
Dialogue: 100,0:34:57.53,0:35:01.58,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,All things eventually come to an end.
Dialogue: 100,0:35:01.87,0:35:04.08,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Whenever I think that, all my fear disappears.
Dialogue: 100,0:35:06.33,0:35:09.84,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,I'll be the one to make \Nthe decisions for myself.
Dialogue: 100,0:35:15.34,0:35:16.43,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Good for you.
Dialogue: 100,0:35:22.56,0:35:23.85,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,We're running out of time.
Dialogue: 100,0:35:24.81,0:35:26.65,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,I'm glad I got to talk to you guys.
Dialogue: 100,0:35:27.40,0:35:29.36,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Since I didn't get to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 100,0:35:33.74,0:35:35.61,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Why was I even born?
Dialogue: 100,0:35:36.36,0:35:38.32,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,That's the only thought \Nthat crossed my mind.
Dialogue: 100,0:35:40.08,0:35:46.00,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,{\q2}But I got to see the next spring \N{\i1}because{\i0} I believed I could be cured.
Dialogue: 100,0:35:47.88,0:35:51.67,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,{\q2}Stop crying over someone \Nwho's been dead for months.
Dialogue: 100,0:35:52.71,0:35:55.97,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,I'm sure things will work out for both of you.
Dialogue: 100,0:35:56.76,0:36:00.10,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,I don't have any proof of that, \Nbut I guarantee you they will.
Dialogue: 100,0:36:01.26,0:36:02.02,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Tomoya.
Dialogue: 100,0:36:03.27,0:36:04.10,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Aoi.
Dialogue: 100,0:36:05.89,0:36:07.19,GJM_Main_1080p,Ry,0,0,0,,Live your best lives.
Dialogue: 100,0:36:30.00,0:36:31.10,GJM_Main_1080p,Ao,0,0,0,,Let's head back.
Dialogue: 100,0:36:34.34,0:36:35.16,GJM_Main_1080p,To,0,0,0,,Sure.
